---
import Demo from '../layouts/Demo.astro';
import meta from '../demos/swarm/meta';
import Island from '../demos/swarm/Demo.tsx';
---
<Demo meta={meta}>
  <Island client:only="react" />
  <div slot="notes">
    <h2>How it works</h2>
    <p>Each agent’s surroundings are described in text. Batched model checks assess danger, nearby prey and whether a boost is useful. Local code handles movement, collisions and cooldowns.</p>
    <h3>Demo scope</h3>
    <p>The arena is simulated. Personality labels identify agents but do not affect the model’s decisions. If an answer becomes stale, local movement rules keep the simulation running.</p>
  </div>
</Demo>
